# Warm start of the expert cache
#
# Engine: llama.cpp tag b12722 (commit e6443bd7eb970d940b0669cd9ea0d82d91d620a1). Apply from the source root: patch -p1 < 3-warm.diff
# What it does: Saves the list of experts held in the card cache at exit and loads it at start, so the first replies are not slow. Does not change the model or the answers.
# Switch: environment LLAMA_MOE_WARM_SAVE=<file> at exit, LLAMA_MOE_WARM_LOAD=<file> at start
# This is an independent patch for people to apply themselves. It is not part of llama.cpp.
#
